---
import MainLayout from '@/components/MainLayout.astro';
import PageWrapper from '@/components/PageWrapper.astro';
---

<PageWrapper title="League Rules | Results Bot">
  <MainLayout
    pageTitle="Official League Rules"
    pageSubtitle="Master the machine. Dominate the league. Here is everything you need to know."
  >
    <main class="rules-container">
      <div class="rules-grid">
        <section class="rule-card">
          <div class="icon-wrapper goal-icon">
            <svg
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <path d="M3 9a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v10a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V9z"></path>
              <path
                d="M9 13a3 3 0 106 0M21 9v10a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V9a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2z"
              ></path>
              <path d="M3 9l9-6 9 6"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>1. The Objective</h3>
          <p>
            Results Bot is a game of intuition vs. data. Predict the scores of Premier League
            matches. While the AI relies on historical probability, you rely on your gut. The goal
            is to maximize points and prove humans still know football best.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="rule-card">
          <div class="icon-wrapper points-icon">
            <svg
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6"></circle>
              <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="6"></circle>
              <path d="M12 8h.01M12 16h.01"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>2. Scoring Points</h3>
          <p>You earn points for accuracy. Tie-breakers are decided by total Exact Scores.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <strong>Correct Result (+3 pts):</strong>
              You picked the winner or draw, but missed the exact score.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Exact Score (+10 pts):</strong>
              You nailed the scoreline perfectly (3 pts Result + 7 pts Bonus).
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="rule-card">
          <div class="icon-wrapper lock-icon">
            <svg
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>3. The Deadlines</h3>
          <p>
            We use a strictly enforced rolling deadline. Predictions lock the exact second that
            specific match kicks off.
          </p>
          <p>
            Predictions for later matches remain editable until their respective kick-off times.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="rule-card">
          <div class="icon-wrapper ai-icon">
            <svg
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="10" rx="2"></rect>
              <circle cx="12" cy="5" r="2"></circle>
              <path d="M12 7v4M8 15h.01M16 15h.01"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>4. The AI Bot</h3>
          <p>
            The "Results Bot" AI is a permanent competitor. It submits final, unchangeable
            predictions 6 hours before the first game of the week. Beat the Bot's weekly total to
            earn the prestigious "Slayer" profile badge.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <footer class="rules-footer">
        <p>
          <em
            >Postponed matches are voided. Abandoned matches follow official PL rulings. Check the
            'Tie-Breakers' section on the Stats page for more detail.</em
          >
        </p>
        <a href="/predictions" class="cta-button">Set Predictions</a>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </MainLayout>
</PageWrapper>

<style>
/* Base Container */
.rules-container {
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 2rem;
  font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
  color: #333; /* Default text */
}

/* The Grid Layout */
.rules-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
  gap: 1.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 3rem;
}

/* Individual Card Styling */
.rule-card {
  background: #fff;
  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  border-radius: 1rem;
  padding: 2rem;
  transition:
    transform 0.2s ease,
    box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center; /* Center content on small screens */
  text-align: center;
}
.rule-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  box-shadow:
    0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1),
    0 4px 6px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
}

/* Icon Wrapper & Basic SVG Styles */
.icon-wrapper {
  width: 60px;
  height: 60px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}
.icon-wrapper svg {
  width: 30px;
  height: 30px;
}

/* Distinct Icon Colors */
.goal-icon {
  background-color: #dbeafe;
  color: #1e40af;
} /* Blue */
.points-icon {
  background-color: #d1fae5;
  color: #065f46;
} /* Green */
.lock-icon {
  background-color: #fee2e2;
  color: #991b1b;
} /* Red */
.ai-icon {
  background-color: #f3e8ff;
  color: #6b21a8;
} /* Purple */

/* Typography */
h3 {
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  color: #111;
}
p {
  font-size: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: #666;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
ul {
  text-align: left; /* Keep list items aligned left */
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  color: #666;
  padding-left: 1rem;
}
li {
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

/* Footer & CTA */
.rules-footer {
  text-align: center;
  border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  padding-top: 2rem;
}
.rules-footer p em {
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  color: #999;
}
.cta-button {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 1.5rem;
  background-color: #4f46e5;
  color: #fff;
  padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
  border-radius: 0.5rem;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: 600;
  transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
}
.cta-button:hover {
  background-color: #4338ca;
}
</style>
